device 1 close
pre-erase off
label case asis
set postscript ppi 800
frame coordinates 12 10 98 99 
ylabel offset units absolute
ylabel offset 11
char size 1
label size 3
tic mark label size 3
char fill on
char circle 
lines blank
device 2 postscript
skip 25
read pontius.dat y x
x1label Load
y1label Residuals
quadratic fit y x
plot res x 
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat gra2b.ps
quit
